<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-BECKER WINS GRAND SLAM CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BECKER WINS GRAND SLAM CUP.</headline>
<text>
<p>MUNICH, Germany, Dec 8 (Reuter) Result of the final of the $6 million Grand Slam Cup on Sunday:</p>
<p>Boris Becker (Germany) beat Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) 6-3 6-4 6-4</p>
</text>
